WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.840
How many of them were AI experts

2
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:04.415
before they started?

3
00:00:06.299 --> 00:00:07.513
None of them

4
00:00:07.594 --> 00:00:09.682
You are not behind.

5
00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:11.499
You do not need to know everything

6
00:00:11.499 --> 00:00:13.779
about AI. Start with one small

7
00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:17.178
task. Ask clearly. Inspect what AI

8
00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:19.099
gives you, and only after checking

9
00:00:19.099 --> 00:00:20.606
it, use it.

10
00:00:21.219 --> 00:00:23.579
Pooja is training as an electrician

11
00:00:23.579 --> 00:00:25.339
and needs to prepare materials for

12
00:00:25.339 --> 00:00:27.097
tomorrow's practical.

13
00:00:27.097 --> 00:00:29.937
Pooja asked the AI for a visual, step by

14
00:00:29.937 --> 00:00:32.177
step guide to installing and testing

15
00:00:32.177 --> 00:00:32.817
earthing plate.

16
00:00:33.337 --> 00:00:35.257
As the instructions and images rendered

17
00:00:35.257 --> 00:00:37.417
on screen, she cross-references them with

18
00:00:37.417 --> 00:00:38.417
her practical notebook.

19
00:00:38.937 --> 00:00:40.937
Satisfied with the line details, she put

20
00:00:40.937 --> 00:00:41.577
them to use.

21
00:00:42.686 --> 00:00:44.406
Sameer is a commerce student,

22
00:00:44.406 --> 00:00:46.285
working on a cash flow and ratio

23
00:00:46.285 --> 00:00:48.046
analysis assignment.

24
00:00:48.046 --> 00:00:50.126
He gives a company's report to AI

25
00:00:50.126 --> 00:00:51.684
to generate the analysis.

26
00:00:51.711 --> 00:00:53.591
The AI generated the entire

27
00:00:53.591 --> 00:00:55.551
assignment in seconds but as soon

28
00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:56.951
as Sameer read the initial lines

29
00:00:56.951 --> 00:00:58.751
of the output he realized

30
00:00:58.751 --> 00:00:59.835
something was off.

31
00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:02.170
The AI claimed that the company

32
00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:04.210
launched an EV charging stations

33
00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:05.729
with direct government subsidy of

34
00:01:05.729 --> 00:01:07.258
15,000 crores.

35
00:01:07.298 --> 00:01:09.298
Sameer checked the report and found the

36
00:01:09.298 --> 00:01:10.138
correct details.

37
00:01:10.418 --> 00:01:12.618
The investment was for the Jamnagar Giga

38
00:01:12.618 --> 00:01:13.298
project.

39
00:01:13.411 --> 00:01:14.931
Sameer pointed out the incorrect

40
00:01:14.931 --> 00:01:16.851
details to the AI and requested

41
00:01:16.851 --> 00:01:18.047
it to fix the data.

42
00:01:18.493 --> 00:01:20.293
After Sameer highlighted the error,

43
00:01:20.573 --> 00:01:21.973
AI corrected the output.

44
00:01:22.413 --> 00:01:24.133
AI can help us work faster,

45
00:01:24.413 --> 00:01:26.053
but its answers should always be

46
00:01:26.053 --> 00:01:26.693
verified.

47
00:01:27.397 --> 00:01:29.317
Meet Neha, a store manager who

48
00:01:29.317 --> 00:01:31.316
needs to identify top selling,

49
00:01:31.316 --> 00:01:33.117
trending, and under performing

50
00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:34.156
products.

51
00:01:34.156 --> 00:01:35.837
To save time, she uploads her

52
00:01:35.837 --> 00:01:38.081
sales report to AI for analysis.

53
00:01:38.082 --> 00:01:40.162
The AI generated a quick dashboard

54
00:01:40.162 --> 00:01:42.401
summary. Neha now side by side

55
00:01:42.401 --> 00:01:44.042
cross checks the AI's high

56
00:01:44.042 --> 00:01:46.162
selling, trending and low selling

57
00:01:46.162 --> 00:01:47.962
categories with the actual store

58
00:01:47.962 --> 00:01:48.662
report.

59
00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:51.108
After comparing every figure, Neha

60
00:01:51.108 --> 00:01:53.228
looks completely satisfied. The AI

61
00:01:53.228 --> 00:01:54.909
output matches her actual sales

62
00:01:54.909 --> 00:01:56.139
data perfectly.

63
00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:59.210
This is Arjun. He works at Meadow

64
00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:01.090
View college and needs to inform

65
00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:02.530
students about a college

66
00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:05.210
orientation. He asks AI to shorten

67
00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.970
the notice while keeping all

68
00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:08.253
important details.

69
00:02:08.671 --> 00:02:10.871
AI gives him a shorter version and

70
00:02:10.871 --> 00:02:12.877
he checks the important details.

71
00:02:13.584 --> 00:02:16.405
The facts match, now he can use it.

72
00:02:16.486 --> 00:02:17.966
They used AI for different

73
00:02:17.966 --> 00:02:20.206
everyday tasks, but one common

74
00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:20.847
rule.

75
00:02:21.311 --> 00:02:24.367
Ask, inspect, and use.
